      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess that -1 is passed. http://cs/android/frameworks/native/libs/binder/ndk/include_cpp/android/binder_auto_utils.h?l\u003d362\u0026rcl\u003de1695a307dc95c3109a2289c60fe723253849780",
