      "writtenOn": "2021-08-25T00:37:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we pass null for the type `@nullable ParcelFileDescriptor`, it\u0027s simply `0\u0027 just like other nullable parcelables. In the C++, `@nullable ParcelFileDescriptor` is mapped to `std::optional\u003cParcelFileDescriptor\u003e` and the value `0` is read as std::nullopt.",
      "parentUuid": "d040fb08_2ac78509",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 103,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 103,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "7f61fe7486384fc2cd59032691e7f85f2041f2d9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
